00:23:00,670 --> 00:23:04,549
because you deserve
a great guy just like Chris.

471
00:23:05,342 --> 00:23:09,179
Just like Gus deserves
a great girl like Mickey,

472
00:23:09,262 --> 00:23:12,557
and Mickey deserves a great guy like Gus.

473
00:23:18,188 --> 00:23:19,147
Was that it?

474
00:23:19,815 --> 00:23:22,359
That's it. Uh, yeah. Thank you. Thank you.

475
00:23:22,776 --> 00:23:25,153
-That's very sweet, Randy. Thank you.
-Okay.

476
00:23:25,237 --> 00:23:28,073
[Mickey] All right. Ahem.
And on that note,

477
00:23:28,156 --> 00:23:29,366
let's go get married.

478
00:23:29,449 --> 00:23:33,245
Yeah, come on! It's good.
It's all right. Hey.

479
00:23:43,547 --> 00:23:46,716
[Terry] Mickey and Gus have requested
to share their vows.

480
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:48,093
Who wants to start?

481
00:23:51,012 --> 00:23:53,723
-Ugh, fine. I'll bite the bullet. Okay.
-[Terry and Gus chuckle]

482
00:23:53,807 --> 00:23:56,810
Uh, don't judge, guys.
I wrote these in, like, an hour.

483
00:23:56,893 --> 00:23:58,395
[all chuckle]

484
00:23:58,478 --> 00:24:01,773
"So, Gus, what's up?

485
00:24:01,857 --> 00:24:03,150
[both chuckle]

486
00:24:04,734 --> 00:24:05,986
My Gus-Gus.

487
00:24:08,447 --> 00:24:09,364
[sighs]

488
00:24:09,447 --> 00:24:13,160
From the moment you killed some
gross bugs for me in my bedroom,

489
00:24:14,369 --> 00:24:16,496
