-[man 2] Sorry.

491
00:24:17,664 --> 00:24:21,084
-Ever since, I knew I could trust you...
-[man 1] We put shirts on this chair!

492
00:24:21,168 --> 00:24:24,254
-to keep me safe, make me feel loved.
-[man 2] I didn't see them.

493
00:24:24,337 --> 00:24:27,549
-[man 1] Why would I lie about it?
-And I promise to believe in you...

494
00:24:27,632 --> 00:24:28,675
[man 1] You mayor of the beach?

495
00:24:28,758 --> 00:24:29,759
-and support you...
-[man 1] Sit in any chair you want?

496
00:24:29,843 --> 00:24:31,386
[man 2] I didn't see any shirt.

497
00:24:31,470 --> 00:24:34,681
and always be the person
who's unafraid to love more.

498
00:24:35,307 --> 00:24:36,558
-[man 1] You steal my shirt?
-I prom--"

499
00:24:36,641 --> 00:24:38,143
Is that what the fuck's going on?

500
00:24:38,226 --> 00:24:39,728
-[woman] Babe, chill.
-[man 2] I've been here three hours.

501
00:24:39,811 --> 00:24:42,439
-Fuck you! We saved these for the sunset.
-Baby.

502
00:24:42,522 --> 00:24:44,024
-[woman] Stop!
-[man 2] Don't touch me!

503
00:24:44,107 --> 00:24:46,234
[man 1] Get out of the chair! Get out!

504
00:24:46,318 --> 00:24:48,361
Should we just, like, wait a minute or...

505
00:24:49,070 --> 00:24:50,906
-Stop! Quit it!
-[man 3] Hey!

506
00:24:50,989 --> 00:24:53,700
-[sighs] God damn it.
-It's okay. It's all right.

507
00:24:53,783 --> 00:24:55,911
-[woman] Stop!
-It's actually kinda funny.

508
00:24:55,994 --> 00:24:58,038
We're gonna wait for these assholes
to work it out.

509
00:24:58,121 --> 00:24:59,789
