-I don't know.

514
00:25:09,341 --> 00:25:11,009
-A heart attack or something.
-Okay.

515
00:25:11,092 --> 00:25:14,179
Jesus Christ. He looks half dead.

516
00:25:14,262 --> 00:25:17,182
