533
00:26:24,291 --> 00:26:26,668
I think we're, like, really good.

534
00:26:27,294 --> 00:26:28,795
Yes, agreed.

535
00:26:29,421 --> 00:26:32,590
I think this is the healthiest,
most mature thing...

536
00:26:33,466 --> 00:26:37,762
you know, for you.
Definitely for me. For us.

537
00:26:37,846 --> 00:26:38,680
Yes.

538
00:26:39,597 --> 00:26:42,183
That's perfect. You're perfect.

539
00:26:42,267 --> 00:26:43,351
You're perfect.

