550
00:27:16,384 --> 00:27:17,886
-[all] Aw.
-[Allan] Boo.

551
00:27:17,969 --> 00:27:20,096
But, hey, not for any bad reasons.

552
00:27:20,180 --> 00:27:21,973
We're still very much in love.

553
00:27:22,057 --> 00:27:25,310
It's just we wanna, you know,
do the responsible thing.

554
00:27:25,393 --> 00:27:28,688
Yeah, and please, we still want
